msgctxt "Languages::ab__sf.rule.generated_categories.tooltip"
msgid "Whether to generate SEO pages for filters by parent categories? For example: the site has a product that belongs to the category Electronics/Computers/Desktops/. If you set <b>Generate SEO pages for filters by all parent categories</b>, then generation will be performed separately for each category: for <i>Electronics</i>, for <i>Computers</i> and for <i>Desktops</i>. If you set <b>Generate SEO pages for filters only by the category to which the products is attached</b>, then the generation will be performed only for the category <i>Desktops</i>, where the product is placed directly"
msgstr "Whether to generate SEO pages for filters by parent categories? For example: the site has a product that belongs to the category Electronics/Computers/Desktops/. If you set <b>Generate SEO pages for filters by all parent categories</b>, then generation will be performed separately for each category: for <i>Electronics</i>, for <i>Computers</i> and for <i>Desktops</i>. If you set <b>Generate SEO pages for filters only by the category to which the products is attached</b>, then the generation will be performed only for the category <i>Desktops</i>, where the product is placed directly"

