msgctxt "Languages::ab__sf.rule.notes"
msgid "<p>Used placeholders for autosubstitution category name, filter name and the feature variant name:<br><b>[category]</b> (as is)<br><b>[category_lower]</b> (lowercase)<br><b>[Category]</b> (capitalize)<br><b>[CATEGORY]</b> (uppercase)<br><b>[filter]</b><br><b>[filter_lower]</b><br><b>[Filter]</b><br><b>[FILTER]</b><br><b>[variant]</b><br><b>[variant_lower]</b><br><b>[Variant]</b><br><b>[VARIANT]</b></p><p>If you have our add-on <a href='https://cs-cart.alexbranding.com/ru/custom-h1-pro.html' target='_blank'>AB: Custom H1 PRO</a>, you can use additional placeholders:<br><b>[category_custom_h1]</b><br><b>[category_custom_h1_lower]</b><br><b>[Category_custom_h1]</b><br><b>[CATEGORY_CUSTOM_H1]</b></p><p><b>For example</b>: for the page field title you can specify:<br><code>[category] [variant] buy</code><br><code>[Category] [VARIANT] buy</code></p>"
msgstr "<p>Used placeholders for autosubstitution category name, filter name and the feature variant name:<br><b>[category]</b> (as is)<br><b>[category_lower]</b> (lowercase)<br><b>[Category]</b> (capitalize)<br><b>[CATEGORY]</b> (uppercase)<br><b>[filter]</b><br><b>[filter_lower]</b><br><b>[Filter]</b><br><b>[FILTER]</b><br><b>[variant]</b><br><b>[variant_lower]</b><br><b>[Variant]</b><br><b>[VARIANT]</b></p><p>If you have our add-on <a href='https://cs-cart.alexbranding.com/ru/custom-h1-pro.html' target='_blank'>AB: Custom H1 PRO</a>, you can use additional placeholders:<br><b>[category_custom_h1]</b><br><b>[category_custom_h1_lower]</b><br><b>[Category_custom_h1]</b><br><b>[CATEGORY_CUSTOM_H1]</b></p><p><b>For example</b>: for the page field title you can specify:<br><code>[category] [variant] buy</code><br><code>[Category] [VARIANT] buy</code></p>"

